slides.prompt:
A vibrant and welcoming title slide that immediately signals a modern, creative approach. A deep purple canvas is layered with organic wavy shapes and accented by bright leafy yellow streaks. A subtle technical texture is added through custom dotted patterns in the background, while the primary title commands attention in a bold, pristine white typeface. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "OrganicHero",
    "alignment": "center"
  },
  "colors": {
    "bg": "#6D28D9",
    "accent_1": "#FACC15",
    "accent_2": "#8B5CF6",
    "text": "#FFFFFF"
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "bg_waves": { "count": 3, "opacity": "0.4" },
    "dot_pattern": { "size": "4px", "gap": "16px", "color": "#FFFFFF", "opacity": "0.1" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "h1": { "size": "72px", "weight": "900", "case": "uppercase" },
    "subline": { "size": "20px", "color": "#FACC15", "weight": "Bold" }
  }
}

A clean and airy mission statement slide that prioritizes approachability. Set against a bright white background, purple wavy shapes frame the top and bottom, creating a professional boundary. A centered Storyset illustration of a man working on a laptop provides a friendly human focus, anchoring the technical mission in a user-centric reality. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "CenteredIllustration",
  "colors": { "bg": "#FFFFFF", "frame": "#6D28D9" },
  "illustration": {
    "type": "storyset-man-laptop",
    "size": "320px",
    "pos": "center-y"
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": { "size": "36px", "weight": "900", "color": "#1E293B" },
    "body": { "size": "16px", "color": "#475569", "max_width": "600px" }
  }
}

A financial overview slide that makes complex data feel approachable. Wavy accents in purple, blue, and yellow create a dynamic flow across the canvas. A budget-themed Storyset illustration acts as a visual anchor, fostering trust through a design that feels both professional and well-planned. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "DataIllustrationSplit",
  "illustration": { "type": "storyset-analytics-money", "pos": "left" },
  "typography": {
    "stat_highlight": { "size": "48px", "weight": "Black", "color": "#6D28D9" },
    "body": "Regular 14px #475569"
  },
  "accents": { "type": "wavy-blobs", "colors": ["#6D28D9", "#3B82F6", "#FACC15"] }
}

A warm team introduction slide that emphasizes the human talent behind the brand. A sophisticated purple wavy footer grounds the white background, while a friendly Storyset illustration of a female professional adds a relatable element. The layout is clean and balanced, inviting the viewer into the company's personal story. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "FriendlyTeamIntro",
  "footer": { "height": "120px", "color": "#6D28D9" },
  "illustration": { "type": "storyset-business-woman", "size": "280px", "pos": "right-bottom" },
  "typography": {
    "headline": "Bold 42px #1E293B",
    "body": "Medium 15px #64748B"
  }
}

A bold and authoritative values slide that establishes the organization's ethical foundation. Utilizing a full-bleed purple wavy background, three distinct columns of high-contrast white text are arranged horizontally. This layout communicates strength, unity, and a solid commitment to the company's core pillars. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ThreeColumnAuthority",
  "bg": "#6D28D9",
  "visuals": { "wave_intensity": "high", "overlay": "linear-gradient(rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.8), rgba(109, 40, 217, 1))" },
  "typography": {
    "pillar_title": "Black 22px #FACC15",
    "pillar_body": "Regular 14px #FFFFFF"
  }
}

A data-focused slide that transitions from vision to evidence with professional grace. A custom Storyset illustration of a researcher at a desk anchors the layout, while the surrounding space is used to present statistical findings in a clean, logical hierarchy. The design communicates deep research and strategic readiness. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ResearcherDashboard",
  "illustration": { "type": "storyset-researcher", "pos": "right" },
  "data_points": {
    "bullet": "leaf-yellow",
    "font": "Medium 16px #1E293B"
  },
  "typography": {
    "stat": "Black 32px #6D28D9"
  }
}

A high-energy detail slide designed to communicate technical depth. Abstract blue and yellow streaks create a sense of rapid motion across the canvas, anchored by a solid purple wavy base. This layout is architected to keep stakeholders engaged during high-density technical discussions and milestone reviews. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "HighEnergyDeepDive",
  "visuals": {
    "streaks": { "colors": ["#3B82F6", "#FACC15"], "angle": "-15deg" },
    "base_wave": "#6D28D9"
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": "Bold 36px #FFFFFF",
    "milestone_text": "Medium 12px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A collaborative-themed slide that emphasizes team alignment and precision. An illustration of two professionals in deep discussion provides the visual focus, while the surrounding layout remains clean and uncluttered. The design communicates that every project detail is scrutinized to ensure a high-fidelity final product. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "CollaborativeFocus",
  "illustration": { "type": "storyset-teamwork", "size": "340px" },
  "typography": {
    "headline": "Bold 28px #1E293B",
    "body": { "size": "14px", "color": "#475569", "border_left": "4px solid #6D28D9" }
  }
}

A memorable and warm closing slide that leaves a lasting impression. A rich purple background is beautifully accented by vibrant leafy yellow shapes, framing a bold centered thank-you message. Contact details are presented in a clean, horizontal layout at the bottom, inviting continued partnership. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "ClosingHero",
  "bg": "#6D28D9",
  "accents": { "type": "leafy-organic", "color": "#FACC15", "pos": "corners" },
  "typography": {
    "thank_you": "Black 64px #FFFFFF",
    "contact_info": "Bold 14px #FACC15",
    "spacing": "48px"
  }
}
